 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nLusitana Ferramentas Lda                                  MASTER SERVICES\nAvenida da Liberdade 50, 1100-053 Lisboa, Portugal        AGREEMENT\nNIF: PT987558827\nReg No: PT-131854\n\nFROM                                                     FATURAR A\n\nLusitana Ferramentas Lda                                 Docupath Solutions Lda\nAvenida da Liberdade 50                                  Avenida da Liberdade 50\n1100-053 Lisboa                                          1100-053 Lisboa\nPortugal                                                 Portugal\nVAT: PT987558827\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 14-03-2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and\nbetween Lusitana Ferramentas Lda, with its registered office at Avenida da Liberdade 50, Lisboa (\"Party A\"), and\nDocupath Solutions Lda, with its registered office at Avenida da Liberdade 50, Lisboa (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 36 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in\naccordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the\npurposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by Swedish law.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A    Lusitana Ferramentas Lda / João Silva\nParty B    Docupath Solutions Lda / João Silva\nDate       14-03-2026",
